{"id":8317156,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/1551","number":1551,"state":"merged","title":"Fix A3 fullmesh bug","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/1551","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/1551/issues","body":"## 描述\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\n问题背景：在A3 16P环境下运行Moe_Distribute_Dispatch_V2算子，使能comm_alg为\"fullmesh_v2\"和动态量化场景下部分用例出现expandx精度问题\n问题原因：fullmesh_v2原代码中PerToken动态量化函数存在PIPE_V量化计算与后面Copy接口的时序问题，而Dispatch公共PerToken量化函数并没有该同步，导致精度出现问题\n修改方法：直接在fullmesh_v2代码的Copy函数前面增加PIPE_V同步\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的问题单，请在这里描述问题单单号。-->\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/issues/769\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n二级冒烟用例Dispatch_fullmesh2_ID015、Dispatch_fullmesh2_ID020等单跑Dispatch\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n","assignees_number":7,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"687eec89d34610402c582825","login":"liuboxi","name":"liuboxi","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liuboxi","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d30360184036954b14d5","login":"wang-minbo","name":"wang-minbo","html_url":"htt